  "foaf:name": "Open Access to GTS Project (Open-GTS Project)",
  "sdo:name": "Open Access to GTS Project (Open-GTS Project)",
  "sdo:description": "The Open Access to GTS (Open-GTS) project aims to ease the exchange of marine data and increase the amount of data available for real-time forecasts.  The ability of Open-GTS to accept multiple data format types is significant and promising.  The application of the Open-GTS workflow will increase the exchange of marine data while retaining data quality and integrity, and its framework will increase transparency and encourage participation from other marine interests, including the commercial shipping industry.",
